Scarf
Crochet Instructions
To Begin: Chain 10
Row 1: 10 sc
Work as many rows as you like.
Fasten off and weave in loose ends.
Knit Instructions
Cast on 10 sts and work single rib (k1, p1) as many rows,
as you like.
