Skirt - Using blue yarn (B)
Rnd # Details Total # of sts
1 With your hook pointing toward the feet of the doll, sc into the first front loop
between rnds 26 and 27 (the BLO round) and into the front loop of each st
around (14).
2 *(2sc into next st, sc into next st), rep from * to end of rnd. (21)
3 *(2sc into next st, sc into next 2 sts), rep from * to end of rnd. (28)
4 Sc into each st around. (28)
5 *(2sc into next st, sc into next 3 sts), rep from * to end of rnd. (35)
6-7 Sc into each st around. (35)
8 *(2sc into next st, sc into next 4 sts), rep from * to end of rnd. (42)
9-10 Sc into each st around. (42)
