Introduction:
Hello our friends and amigurumi lovers around the world, Muslim around the world celebrate
the Prophet Mohamed’s birthday “Mawlid al-Nabi” every year.
In Egypt 🇪🇬, the celebration originated from the Fatimid’s era, are usually joyful and colorful.
There are always candy dolls for children, which come in two forms, the sugar doll “Arousset Al
Moulid “dressed as brides and sultan on horse- also made of sugar decorated with colored
paper.
Today we launch our design for new soft Amigurumi Arousset Al Moulid doll. Which is made
with amazing colorful yarns. With pleasure to provide you with free pattern in (Arabic - English)
