Making the bow
Leave a little yarn tail to fasten off. Cut a little piece of beige colour yarn to make a little bow on the top of the lid. Thread the both ends of the little piece
of yarn onto two yarn needles. Insert the needles opposite each other from inside of the lid between the first and the second rounds. Pull two yarn ends
th rough the holes between the 1st & the 2nd rounds to tie a little bow. Photos below will give you some idea how to make the bow.
Insert both of the yarn needles through the holes between the 1st & 2nd rounds as you see in the photo left above. Pull the yarn ends through the holes as
you see in the photo right above.
Tie a bow with the beige colour yarn and put the lid on the box. Little
gift box for your little bunny is ready 
