R: Row
Rnd : round
Ch: chain stitch
slst : slip stitch
sc: single crochet stitch
inc: single crochet 2 stitches in same sc
3sc inc: 3 single crochet increase
dec: single crochet 2 stitches in front loops together
hdc : half double crochet stitch
dc : double crochet stitch
indc: double crochet increase
inchdc: half double crochet increase
decdc: double crochet decrease
st, sts : stitch, stitches
dechdc: half double crochet decrease
FLO: crochet through front loops only
BLO: crochet through back loops only
( )*6: repeat 6 times
The head
Use white color yarn, work in round
Head
Rnd 1: 6sc in mc (6)
Rnd 2: inc* 6 (12)
Rnd3: (3inc, 3sc)*2 (18)
Rnd4: (sc, inc)*3, 3sc, (sc, inc)*3, 3sc (24)
Rnd5: (2sc, inc)*3, 3sc, (2sc, inc)*3, 3sc (30)
Rnd6: 30sc (30)
Rnd7: (3sc, inc)*3, 3sc, (3sc, inc)*3, 3sc (36)
Rnd8: sc, (inc, 4sc)*3, 3sc, (inc, 4sc)*3, 2sc (42)
Rnd9: (5sc, inc)*3, 3sc, (5sc, inc)*3, 3sc (48)
Rnd10: sc, (inc, 6sc)*3, 3sc, (inc, 6sc)*3, 2sc (54)
Rnd11: 54sc (54)
Rnd12: (7sc, inc)*3, 3sc, (7sc, inc)*3, 3sc (60)
Rnd13: 2sc, (inc, 8sc)*3, 3sc, (inc, 8sc)*3, 2sc (66)
Rnd14: (9sc, inc)*3, 3sc, (9sc, inc)*3, 3sc (72)
Rnd15: 72sc (72)
Rnd16: 13sc, (inc, 6sc)*3, 15sc, (inc, 6sc)*3, 2sc (78)
Rnd17: 78sc (78)
Rnd18: (7sc, inc)*3, 15sc, (7sc, inc)*3, 15sc (84)
Head
Rnd19-23: 84sc (84)
Rnd24: (14sc,dec)*2, 10sc, (14sc,dec)*2, 10sc (80)
Rnd25: 80sc (80)
Rnd26: 2sc, (12sc, dec)*2, 13sc, (12sc, dec)*2, 9sc (76)
Rnd27: 4sc, (10sc, dec)*2, 15sc, (10sc, dec)*2, 9sc (70)
Rnd28: (10sc, dec)*6 (66)
Rnd29: 4sc, dec, (9sc, dec)*5, 5sc (60)
Rnd30: (8sc, dec)*6 (54)
Rnd31: 3sc, dec, (7sc, dec)*5, 4sc (48)
Rnd32: (2sc,dec)*12 (36)
Rnd33: (4sc, dec)*6 (30)
Rnd34: 1sc, dec, (3sc, dec)*5, 2sc (24)
Fasten off and leave a long tail for sewing
Start stuffing the head
Arms: (make 2)
Use white color yarn, work in round
Rnd 1: 6sc in mc (6)
Rnd 2: inc* 6 (12)
Rnd3-9: 12sc
Fasten off and leave a long tail for
sewing
Start stuffing the arms
Legs (make 2)
Use white color yarn, work in round
Rnd 1: 6sc in mc (6)
Rnd 2: inc* 6 (12)
Rnd3: (3inc, 3sc)*2 (18)
Rnd4: (sc, inc)*3, 3sc, (sc, inc)*3, 3sc
(24)
Rnd5-7: 24sc (24)
Fasten off and leave a long tail for
sewing
Start stuffing the legs
The Body
Use white color yarn, work in round
Rnd 1: 7Ch, Start crochet at the 2nd chain from the
hook: 5 sc, 3sc inc , 4 sc, inc, (14)
Rnd 2: 1inc, 4sc, 3inc, 4sc, 2inc ( 20)
Rnd 3: 1inc, 6sc, 4inc, 6sc, 3inc (28)
Rnd 4: 1inc, 8sc, 1inc, 1sc, 2inc, sc, 1inc, 8sc, 1inc, 1sc,
2inc,1sc (36)
Rnd 5-16: 36sc (36)
Rnd 17: (4sc, dec)*6 (30)
Fasten off and leave a long tail for sewing
Start stuffing the body
Leaf on the head
Use green color yarn, work in round
Piece 1:
Rnd 1: 5sc in mc (6)
Rnd2: 5sc
Rnd3 : (sc, inc) *2, sc (7)
Rnd4: 7sc
Piece 2: Do same as piece1 until Rnd 4
Rnd 5: Join two pieces into one piece : conect 2
pieces together by SL stitch. skip this SL,
crochet 6 sc on the piece 1, then crochet 6 sc
on the piece 2 ( total 12 sc)
Rnd5: 2sc, 2dec, 2sc, 2dec (8)
Rnd6: 8sc (8)
Fasten off and leave a long tail for sewing
Assembling Face:
Leaf: sew the leaf on the head
eye: sew the eyes between Rnd 17 and Rnd 20. The space between 2 eyes is 12 sts.
smile: sew the smile between Rnd 17 and Rnd 19. The space between eye and smile is 2 sts.
rosy cheek: sew the rosy cheek with pink color yarn
You’re done!
