1
MATERIALS TO CREATE YOUR OWN LITTLE
MINION!!!
- mercerized crochet thread in yellow [your choice of
minion
shade. personally, i chose a more pale yellow]; black;
materials white; and grey
- crochet hook #4 [1.25mm]
- stitch markers
- dress maker's pins [the one with the flat top]
- fiberfill stuffing
- brown felt
- hole puncher
- tapestry needle [i used the one that you use for sewing
machines]
1
Please take note of the ff:
- inc -- making 2 sc in one stitch
- dec -- making an sc2tog
- inv dec -- dec through the blo
- blo -- back loop only
- flo -- front loop only
- weave ends together - closes the whole making it look
like one whole 3D piece [ex: a circle]
- sew ends together - sewing the parallel ends together
to form a flat object
- hdc inc - making 2 hdc in one stitch
For other questions, please do not hesitate to e-mail me @ shannennicolex3@yahoo.com or message
me on tumblr or facebook. I always try to reply asap :D
