1. using your hole puncher, punch a hole in the felt [this
is to make a perfect circle for the eye]
2.sew this eye to the white part of each of the goggle. the
position is all up to you
assembly
optional: using your flat head dressmakers pin, place the
pin towards the upper part of the eye to create the white
circle usually found in normal cartoon eyes
3. stuff all the pieces [for the goggle, make sure to just
lightly stuff it]
4. get your pin, position the goggle strap towards the 14th
row of the head/body
5. position the goggle to where the strap’s ends meet
6. sew the goggles [strap and goggles themselves] to the
head/body
7. using the brown thread, make a small u for the smile
7
8.for the french maid outfit:
a.sew the pocket directly below the white row
b.make a bow using an extra piece of thread
and sew it to the dress. for mine, i just pinned
