Heart Cactus
:
Rnd 1: With green. Ch 8, sl st in first ch to form ring, ch1, sc in each ch around. (8)
Rnd 2: (2 sc in next st, sc in next 2 sts, 2 sc in next st) 2 times. (12)
Rnd 3: Sc in each st around.
Rnd 4: (2 sc in next st, sc in next 4 sts, 2 sc in next st) 2 times. (16)
Rnd 5: Sc in each st around.
Rnd 6: (2 sc in next st, sc in next 6 sts, 2 sc in next st) 2 times. (20)
Rnd 7: (2 sc in next st, sc in next 8 sts, 2 sc in next st) 2 times. (24)
Rnd 8: (2 sc in next st, sc in next 10 sts, 2 sc in next st) 2 times. (28)
Rnd 9-12: Sc in each st around.
Working in rows.
Row 13: First point, sc first 2 sts tog, sc in next 3 sts, sc next 2 sts tog, turn. (5)
Row 14: Ch 1, sc in each st across, turn. (5)
Row 15: Ch 1, sc first 2 sts tog, sc in next st, sc next 2 sts tog, fasten off. (3)
Row 13: Second-fouth points , join with sl st to next free st on rnd 12, ch 1, sc first 2 sts tog,
sc in next 3 sts, sc next 2 sts tog, turn. (5)
Row 14: Ch 1, sc in each st across, turn. (5)
Row 15: Ch 1, sc first 2 sts tog, sc in next st, sc next 2 sts tog, fasten off. (3)
Matching points; sew end of heart side together. Do not stuff.
