Introduction:
Hello our friends and amigurumi lovers around the world, we are happy to share with you our
small sweets amigurumi recycle pattern, don’t throw anything away because we will recycle it
into this beautiful items. In this pattern we need only (plastic mineral water bottles cover, leftover
threads yarn, crochet hook and glue gun). Crochet and amigurumi beginners will have a good
chance to produce items with zero sewing. Such a beautiful soft small sweets are multi use as a
keychain, magnet for refrigerator and also a lovely Valentine’s keychain after using appropriate
thread colors and also it is wonderful to use them as toys for children, safe and easy to clean and
wash. This pattern is written and designed by Reham Youssef the owner of R.Y amigurumi and
please note that it is for your personal used only and it is not allowed to sharing and reselling in
Internet, we are the owner of this pattern and for any issue related to that please contact with us
by using our email: reham.youssef821974@gmail.com
