Heart Pattern
Sew the little hole between the two pieces with the tail
The heart is made by two pieces that are then joined left from Piece A.
together to complete the heart.
Piece A
make two (colour C1)
Rnd 1: ch 2, sc 4 in second ch from hook (4)
Rnd 2: 2sc in each sc around (8)
Rnd 3: sc around (8)
Rnd 4: * sc 1, 2sc in next sc* rep (12) Rnd 3: sc 1, [sc 5, dec 1] three times (19)
Rnd 5: sc around (12) Rnd 4: sc 2, dec 1, [sc 3, dec 1] three times (15)
