between the two pieces after joining them.
Begin stuffing with fibrefill as you go.
Rnd 5: sc 1, dec 1, [sc 2, dec 1] three times (11)
Important: at the end of the second piece do not cut
Rnd 6: sc around (11)
the yarn as you will continue to make Piece B.
Rnd 7: dec 1, [sc 1, dec 1] three times (7)
Finish stuffing, close off the hole at the end, and
