ABOUT THE PATTERN
With Christmas right around the corner, little Santa is a perfect addition to your holiday -
whether as a gift or ornament, Santa is sure to be a hoot!
ABOUT THE AUTHOR
Shannen is the owner and designer behind Sweet N’ Cute Creations. Just recently, she released
her very first book, Huggable Amigurumi, which features 18 adorably cute animals. She has
been featured in other books such as Zoomigurumi 2 and Animals-At-Work, in Inside Crochet
Magazine, Mollie Makes, and We Love Amigurumi.
To order her book, head on over to bit.ly/huggableamigurumi or head on over to your local
bookstores or craftstores.
