Large Straight Bunny
Legs & Body Step One
Colour: Pap er White
Same as the sm all bunny, we will start crocheting the big bunny from the legs and then join the legs together, then carry on crocheting the body.
Numbers are of course different as this bunny is bigger, but the methods are the same. So, let’s get started, shall we 
