This pattern uses UK terms. • MR — magic ring
• SS — slip stitch
• BLO — back loop only of the stitch
• St / sts — stitch / stitches
• Ch — chain stitch
• Trb — treble stitch [US double crochet]
• DC — double crochet stich [US single crochet]
• Dec — DC decrease (work one DC across two DC sts)
• To change colours — change the colour on the last
• Dtrb — double treble stitch [US treble]
step of the previous stitch.
• FLO — front loop only of the stitch
• Htrb — half treble stitch [US half double]
