Round 1: MR, (Chain 3 and 2 dc inside the magic ring, add 3 more
chains and sl st inside) x3. Add chain 6, cut the yarn and sew the
stem to the center.
Blueberry (Make 3=2/Blue and 1/Purple)
Start with Blue/Purple color yarn.
Round 1: MR 6 sc (6 sts)
Round 2: 1 inc in each st around (12 sts)
Round 3-5: 1 sc in each st around (12 sts)
 Place stuffing inside the piece.
Round 6: 1 dec in each st around (6 sts)
Finish off.
Assembling:
 Place the Bananas in the center of the Bowl.
 Sew one piece of Cream on top of each Ice cream scoop.
 Sew the Cherries on top of the Cream.
 Place the Scoops on top of the Bananas, and add the Straw-
berries and Blueberries around.
 Have fun!
