Tail
Color yellow, brown
We cut off 6 strands of yellow and brown color, about 13 cm (12 in total). All drag in the place where the tail
is supposed to be, we tie all threads close to the trunk with a separate thread, the ends of this thread are
attached to the remaining threads of the tail. The tail can be cut to one length or leave it irregular.
