TUTORIALS
LOOP STITCH
Insert the hook into the stitch and wrap a loop of yarn around your index finger.
Bring the hook over and around the near side of the yarn and then under the far
side of the yarn and around the near side yarn. Bring the hook back up through
the stitch and yarn over. The loop stitch is complete.
