Sweet Oddity Art;https://www.lovecrafts.com/en-gb/p/bumble-the-bee-crochet-pattern-by-carolyne-brodie;"Abbreviations:
mr= magic ring- crochet single crochet stitches in to the
adjustable loop BLO= back loops only
ch= chain stitch F/O= Fasten off
sc= single crochet stitch inc3= 3 sc in the same stitch
sl= slip stitch
dc= double crochet stitch
inc= increase- make two single crochet stitches in the same stitch
dec=decrease- crochet two stitches together using the decrease method
(4 sc, inc) x 6= repeat the pattern between parentheses 6 times
Notes:
• Do not join rounds unless stated, work in a continuous spiral
• Use a stitch marker to mark the beginning of each round
• All stitches are worked in both loops unless stated otherwise in the pattern
Sweet Oddity Art 2
Head:
Crocheted from top of head to bottom
With Color A:
1. Make 6 sc into a magic ring= 6
2. Increase in each st around= 12
3. (sc, inc) x 6= 18
4. sc, inc, (2 sc, inc) x 5, sc= 24
5. (3 sc, inc) x 6= 30
6. 2 sc, inc, (4 sc, inc) x 5, 2 sc= 36
7. (5 sc, inc) x 6= 42
8. 3 sc, inc, (6 sc, inc) x 5, 3 sc= 48
9-14. sc in each st around
Place eyes between rounds 12 and 13, leaving 10 holes between them. Place nose in between
eyes between rounds 13 and 14. (On page 17, there are different options for noses if wanted)
TIP! You may have to adjust the eye placement depending on yarn and hook size you use.
15. 3 sc, dec, (6 sc, dec) x 5, 3 sc= 42
16. (5 sc, dec) x 6= 36
Start stuffing the head
17. 2 sc, dec, (4 sc, dec) x 5, 2 sc= 30
18. (3 sc, dec) x 6= 24
19. (2 sc, dec) x 6= 18
F/O and leave a tail. (the tail does not need to be long)
Sweet Oddity Art 3
Body: Arms(Make 2):
With Color A: With Color A:
1. Make 6 sc into a magic ring= 6 1. Make 6 sc into a magic ring= 6
2. Increase in each st around= 12 2. Increase in each st around= 12
3. (sc, inc) x 6= 18 3-6. Sc in each st around
4. (inc, 2 sc) x 6= 24 Stop stuffing the arms
5. (3 sc, inc) x 6= 30 7. 5 sc, dec, 5 sc= 11
6. 2 sc, inc, (4 sc, inc) x 5, 2 sc= 36 8. Sc in each st around
7-13. sc in each st around 9. 4 sc, dec, 3 sc, dec= 9
14. (5 sc, dec) x 4, 8 sc= 32 10. Sc in each st around
15. (4 sc, dec) x 3, 14 sc= 29 11. 7 sc, dec= 8
16. (dec, 7 sc) x 2, dec, 9 sc= 26 12-16. Sc in each st around
17. 3 sc, dec, 16 sc, dec, 3 sc= 24 F/O and leave a long tail for sewing
Start stuffing the body !Tip! If you fold the arms in half
18. sc in each st around and sc closed, you will have an
19. 8 sc, dec, 4 sc, dec, 8 sc= 22 easier time when sewing them.
20. sc in each st around
21. dec, 8 sc, dec, 10 sc= 20
22. sc in each st around
23. (dec, 8 sc) x 2= 18
F/O and leave a long tail for sewing
Bow:
With Color C:
1. Make a magic ring and ch 4
2. Into the magic ring: make 3 tr, ch 4, sl st, ch 4, 3 tr, ch 4, sl st
F/O and leave an extra long tail for sewing
Sweet Oddity Art 4
Legs(Make 2):
Starting with Color C:
Ch 6
1. inc in 2nd chain from hook, 3 sc, 4 sc in the last chain, working on the opposite side of the
chain: 3 sc, inc= 14
*For help with working on the opposite side of the chain refer to page 15*
2. Inc3, 4 sc, inc3, 2 sc, inc3, 5 sc= 20
3. inc x 3, 5 sc, inc3, 4 sc, inc3, 6 sc= 27
4. sc, inc x 3, 8 sc, inc3, 6 sc, inc3, 7 sc= 34
Change to Color A:
5-7. sc in each st around
8. 17 sc, dec x 6, 5 sc= 28
Stuff the legs as you work
9. 16 sc, dec x 4, 4 sc= 24
10. 15 sc, dec x 4, sc= 20
11. 12 sc, dec x 4= 16
Stop stuffing the legs
12. (dec, 6 sc) x 2= 14
13. sc in each st around
14. (dec, 5 sc) x 2= 12
15. sc in each st around
16. (dec, 4 sc) x 2= 10
17. sc in each st around
F/O and leave a long tail for sewing
Antennaes(Make 2):
Starting with Color B:
Heart Humps(Make 2):
1. Make 6 sc into a magic ring= 6
2. (sc, inc) x 3= 9
3. sc in each st around
Do not F/O the 2nd hump!
4. Work a single crochet in the 2nd hump to connect the 1st hump and 2nd hump together.
Work 8 more sc around, work 9 sc in the next hump= 18
5. sc in each st around
6. (4 sc, dec) x 3= 15
7. (3 sc, dec) x 3= 12
8. (2 sc, dec) x 3= 9
9. (sc, dec) x 3= 6
Stop stuffing
Change to Color A:
10-13. sc in each st around
F/O and leave a long tail for sewing
Sweet Oddity Art 5
Wings(Make 2):
With Color D:
1. Make 6 sc into a magic ring= 6
2. Increase in each st around= 12
3. (sc, inc) x 6= 18
4. (2 sc, inc) x 6= 24
5. (3 sc, inc) x 6= 30
6-7. sc in each st around
8. (3 sc, dec) x 6= 24
9-10. sc in each st around
Do not stuff the wings
11. (2 sc, dec) x 6= 18
12-13. sc in each st around
14. (sc, dec) x 6= 12
15. sc in each st around
F/O and leave a long tail for sewing
!TIP! If you fold the wings in half and sc the opening closed, sewing will be much easier!
Sweet Oddity Art 6
Assembly
Head and Body:
1. Cut a long strand of white embroidery thread. Insert the needle into the bottom of
the head. Bring the needle up to a corner on the bottom of the eye. Insert the needle
into a hole around to the top of the eye. Make sure you do not pull the thread too
tightly. Repeat on the 2nd eye and weave in the tails.
2. Sew the head to the body. You may need to add stuffing when you get to the last few
stitches to close.
Sweet Oddity Art 7
Antennae:
1. Optional: Cut a piece of pipe cleaner in half. Fold the half in half again and twist.
Insert the pipe cleaner into the lower half of the antenannae. Cut any excess off.
You can choose to stuff them instead.
2. Pin the antennaes onto the head approximately between rounds 6 and 8.
3. Sew the antennaes onto the head.
Sweet Oddity Art 8
Sweet Oddity Art 9
Arms:
1. Pin the arms to the side of the body approximately between rounds 21 and 22.
2. Sew the arms onto the body in a forward facing angle.
Bow:
1. Pin the bow onto the front of the body.
2. Sew the bow onto the neck.
Sweet Oddity Art 10
Legs:
1. Turn the body upside down with the front of the face facing away from you.
Pin the legs onto the bottom of the body approximately between rounds 4 and 5.
2. Sew the legs onto the body.
Sweet Oddity Art 11
Wings:
1. Pin the wings onto the back of the body.
2. Sew the wings onto the back of the body.
Mouth:
1. Thread your needle with a long strand of black thread. Insert the needle into a spot
on the side of the head and bring the needle up to a hole on the side of the face.
2. Embroider a smile.
3. Weave in the ends.
Sweet Oddity Art 12
