Sweet Oddity Art 13
Helpful Tips:
Exact Colors and Brand of Yarn Used:
1. Mint: Big Twist Mint
2. Pink: Red Heart Bubblegum
3. Purple: I love this yarn Amethyst
4. Variegated yarn: Red heart Monet
You can use different eye and nose sizes. You might have to adjust the placements if you
change the sizes.
You can use different hook sizes and weights of yarn. It will just change the size of your
butterfly and you might need to adjust eye and nose placement.
How you stuff matters! The type of stuffing you use, how you stuff, all this matters on how your
