1. Wrap the scarf around the front of the neck with one side overlapping the other.
2. Pin the scarf onto the front
3. Sew the scarf onto the neck.
Sweet Oddity Art 13
Mouth and Eyebrows:
1. Thread your needle with a long strand of black thread. Insert the needle into a spot
on the side of the head and bring the needle up to a hole above the eye. Embroider an
eyebrow. Repeat for the opposite eye.
2. Embroider a smile with the same technique as the eyebrows. Weave in the ends.
3. Add some blush to the cheeks with actual blush.
4. Thread your needle with a long strand of white yarn. Insert the needle into a spot on
side of the head. Insert the needle into a lower corner of the eye. Wrap the yarn and
needle to the top of the eye and insert the needle into a hole. Do not pull too tightly.
Weave in the ends. This will add a little highlight to the eye.
