MATERIALS
- feel free to amend as you like
2.0mm Crochet Hook (or adjust size to your chosen yarn weight)
Stuffing
Stitch Markers
Yarn Needle
Scissors
Yarn as follows (all only require 1 or less skein):
o DK Peach Yarn (for skin)
o DK Black Yarn (for hair, pants)
o DK Dark Pink Yarn (for skirt, bunny ears)
o DK Light Pink Yarn (for hoodie)
o DK Light Grey Yarn (for shoes, top)
