Ch Chain
Sc Single crochet
INC Single crochet increase
DEC Single crochet decrease
HDc Half double crochet
HDcINC Half double crochet increase
Dc Double crochet
DcINC Double crochet increase
Tc Triple crochet
TcINC Triple crochet increase
