Working on both sides of the chain,
Rnd 1 ch 4, starting in the 2nd chain (8)
from the hook, 2 Sc, 3 Sc in the last
stitch, 1 Sc, 2 Sc into the first stitch
Rnd 2 1 INC, 1 Sc, 3 INC, 1 Sc, 2 INC (14)
Cut yarn and fasten off. Leave a long tail
for sewing.
