Candy Corn
Start off using white yarn
Round 1: 6 SC in Magic Circle (6)
Round 2: SC around (6)
Round 3: INC around (12), on last stitch change to orange yarn
Round 4: (SC, INC) X 6 (18)
Round 5-6: SC around (18), on last stitch change to yellow yarn
Round 7: (2SC, INC) X 6 (24)
Round 8: SC around (24)
Round 9: (2SC, DEC) X 6 (18)
Stop and put the eyes in between rows 5 and 6 with 5 stitches between them. Then using your
black yarn stitch on the mouth in between the eyes.
Round 10: (SC, DEC) X 6 (12)
Lightly stuff
Round 11: DEC around (6), SL
Finish stuffing until nice and firm and then close-up the hole with your needle.
Attach keychain
Cut a long piece of white yarn to sew the keychain to the top of the candy corn. You will need to
loop the yarn through the last ring of the keychain and the top of the candy corn. Once secure
you will tuck in your ends.
Now your Candy Corn Keychain
is complete…
