https://www.buddyrumi.com/blog/2013/3/29/light-bulb-curly-hair-with-acrylic-
yarn.html
Whichever you choose. You are going to want to cut many strands of the yarn.
Attach the yarn to the top of the head in 2 groups for 2 ponytails.
Attach some flower buttons to the hair and onto the body.
