2.75mm hook Rnd - round
Infinity Hearts Rose 8/4 White (02) MR – Magic Ring
Toy stuffing DC – Double Crochet
Safety eyes x 2 St(s) – stitch(es)
Tapestry needle DC2tog – Double crochet two stitches
together (decrease stitch)
