Round 3: inc, sc 6= [8]
Round 4: inc, sc 7= [9]
Round 5: inc, sc 8= [10]
Round 6: inc, sc 9= [11]
Round 7: inc, sc 10= [12]
Round 8 FHL: inc 12= [24] (Crochet through the front halves of the loops only)
Round 9: (sc 3, inc) x 6 = [30] (Crochet through both halves of the loop)
Cut the yarn leaving a long yarn tail for sewing and fasten off.
Sew a key chain to the hat.
