Yarn Portuguese Brand sequence
@Croche Estrela – Tricot Baby […] - Nº off stitch in rounds
Sheep Colors – Beige 087, White 088,
Pink 766
Bunny Colors – Pink 766, White 088,
Blue 430, Light Pink 749, Yellow 629
