SIZE: ABOUT 2.36 X 2.36 INCHES (6X6 CM)
TIP! You can use the same pattern to make larger or smaller toys
by using finer or bulkier yarn. Also you can use a different color
yarn. Pick a crochet hook at least a size smaller than suggested on
yarn label and crochet tightly enough to achieve a tight gauge that
will not allow the stuffing to show through the fabric.
