HEART
Round 1: mr, sc 6 = [6]
Round 2: (sc 1, inc) x 3 = [9]
Round 3: (sc 2, inc) x 3 = [12]
Round 4: sc 2, inc 2, sc 4, inc 2, sc 2 = [16]
Round 5: sc in each st around = [16]
Round 6: sc 3, inc 2, sc 6, inc 2, sc 3 = [20]
Round 7: sc in each st around = [20]
Round 8: sc 4, inc 2, sc 8, inc 2, sc 4 = [24]
Round 9: sc 5, inc 2, sc 10, inc 2, sc 5 = [28]
Round 10: sc 6, inc 2, sc 12, inc 2, sc 6 = [32]
Round 11: sc 7, inc 2, sc 14, inc 2, sc 7 = [36]
Round 12-13(2 rounds): sc in each st around = [36]
Round 14: Make sl st into the 18th st from the start
of the round. Now we have 2 equal pieces
of 18 stitches each. Continue to crochet to the left.
sc in each st around = [18]
Round 15: (sc 1, dec) x 6= [12]
Round 16: dec 6= [6]
Cut the yarn leaving a yarn tail for fasten off. Stuff the heart tightly.
After you have finished crochet the first side of the heart, join the yarn with sl st and make Cs 1,
continue crochet to the left.
Round 1: sc in each st around = [18]
Round 2: (sc 1, dec) x 6= [12] Finish stuffing.
Round 3: dec 6= [6]
Cut the yarn leaving a yarn tail for fasten off.
