With Color E:
Attach yarn to the sides with a sl st. Approximately between rows 19 and 20 of the body.
Make 6 sc into the body.
1. Ch 1, turn, sc across= 6
2. Ch 1, turn, inc across= 12
3. Ch 1, turn, sc across= 12
4. Ch 1, turn, inc across= 24
F/O and weave in the ends
Sweet Oddity Art 9
Top Fin:
With Color D:
Place a pin between rounds 18 and 19, on the middle of the head. Attach yarn to top of
head with a sl st.
Make 10 sc
1. Ch 1, turn, sc across= 10
2. Ch 1, turn, inc across= 20
3. Ch 1, turn, sc across= 20
4. Ch 1, turn, inc across= 40
