Sweet Oddity Art 10
Assembly
Take a long strand of white yarn. Thread your needle. Insert the needle into a hole in between
the eyes. Bring the needle up to a lower corner of the eye. Wrap the needle around the outside
of the eye. Insert the needle into a hole on top of the eye. Pull a little tightly. Repeat for the 2nd
eye. This is to give the eye a highlight if you want.
You completed all your assembly during the pattern!
You have your finished kissing fish! Thank you for your purchase! If you have any questions or
concerns please email me at sweetoddityart@gmail.com or etsy convo me. I will get back to
you asap. Please share your finished kissing fish with me as often as you want! I love seeing
them!
Sweet Oddity Art 11
Helpful Tips:
Exact Colors and Brand of Yarn Used:
For Purple Fish:
1. Purple: I love this yarn orchid
2. Variegated Yarn: Lion Brand Critter Craze
3. Pink: Red Heart Petal Pink
Yellow Fish:
1. Variegated Yarn: Red Heart Retro Stripe
2. Pink: Big Twist Medium Rose
3. Teal: I love this yarn Ocean
You can use different eye and nose sizes. You might have to adjust the placements if you
change the sizes.
You can use different hook sizes and weights of yarn. It will just change the size of your fish and
you might need to adjust eye and nose placement.
How you stuff matters! The type of stuffing you use, how you stuff, all this matters on how your
fish turns out. I prefer Polyfil stuffing but you can use other types.
