K & J Dolls: Pattern designed by Sayjai Thawornsupacharoen 2
Body:
Rnd 1: With black. Ch 5, join to form a ring, ch1, 6 sc in a ring. (6)
Rnd 2: 2 sc in each st around. (12)
Rnd 3: (Sc in next st, 2 sc in next st) around. (18)
Rnd 4: (Sc in next 2 sts, 2 sc in next st) around. (24)
Rnd 5: (2 sc in next st, sc in next 3 sts) around. (30)
Rnd 6-24: Sc in each st around, join with sl st to first st, fasten off.
Flower:
Rnd 1: With yellow. Ch 4, join to form a ring, ch1, 12 sc in a ring,
changing to red in last 2 loops of last st. (12)
Rnd 2: (Sc in next st, ch 2, 4 dc in next st, ch 2) 6 times,
join with sl st to first st, fasten off.
Sew flower on body with white bead in the middle, as shown in
picture.
Strap:
With red. Ch 40, sc in second chain from hook,
sc in each ch across, leave long end for sewing,
