Rd 2 1ch, *[2dc]* crochet 6 times, 1ss in first ch (12sts)
1ch, *1dc, [2dc]* crochet 6 times (18sts). Fasten off invisibly. Leave a long tail, you
Rd 3
will need it to make a small knot.
Take black yarn and make 1ss in back loop of each dc going around the edge, pic.21.
Rd 4
Fasten off invisibly. Leave a long tail to sew the eyes onto the face.
