Material: YarnArt Lily in black, hook size: 1.0mm;
How to make: Crochet chart 3.
- 2ch, 6dc in 2nd ch from hook, invisible fastening off.
Crochet chart 3.
Sew on the black circle to the left side of each eye; pull the needle with white yarn (which is left
