Attach the yarn to any stitch of the last round of the hat cone (pic.51) and make:
Rd 1
*5dc, [2dc]* crochet 6 times (42sts)
Rd 2 *6dc, [2dc]* crochet 6 times (48sts)
Rd 3 *7dc, [2dc]* crochet 6 times (54sts)
Rd 4 *8dc, [2dc]* crochet 6 times (60sts)
