10. SCARF
Material: Hayfield Bonus DK in royal blue, hook size 3.0mm;
How to make: Crochet chart 8.
Row 1 41ch, 1dc in 3rd ch from hook, *1ch, skip 1ch, 1dc in next ch* repeat 19 times, turn;
Row 2 2ch, (skip 1dc, 1ch, 1dc), 1dc in next ch sp, *1ch, 1dc in next ch sp* repeat 17 times, turn;
Row 3 2ch, (skip 1dc, 1ch, 1dc), 1dc in next ch sp, *1ch, 1dc in next ch sp* repeat 16 times, turn;
Row 4 2ch, (skip 1dc, 1ch, 1dc), 1dc in next ch sp, *1ch, 1dc in next ch sp* repeat 15 times, turn;
Row 5 2ch, (skip 1dc, 1ch, 1dc), 1dc in next ch sp, *1ch, 1dc in next ch sp* repeat 14 times, turn;
Row 6 2ch, (skip 1dc, 1ch, 1dc), 1dc in next ch sp, *1ch, 1dc in next ch sp* repeat 13 times, turn;
Row 7 2ch, (skip 1dc, 1ch, 1dc), 1dc in next ch sp, *1ch, 1dc in next ch sp* repeat 12 times, turn;
Row 8 2ch, (skip 1dc, 1ch, 1dc), 1dc in next ch sp, *1ch, 1dc in next ch sp* repeat 11 times, turn;
Row 9 2ch, (skip 1dc, 1ch, 1dc), 1dc in next ch sp, *1ch, 1dc in next ch sp* repeat 10 times, turn;
Row 10 2ch, (skip 1dc, 1ch, 1dc), 1dc in next ch sp, *1ch, 1dc in next ch sp* repeat 9 times, turn;
Row 11 2ch, (skip 1dc, 1ch, 1dc), 1dc in next ch sp, *1ch, 1dc in next ch sp* repeat 8 times, turn;
Row 12 2ch, (skip 1dc, 1ch, 1dc), 1dc in next ch sp, *1ch, 1dc in next ch sp* repeat 7 times, turn;
Row 13 2ch, (skip 1dc, 1ch, 1dc), 1dc in next ch sp, *1ch, 1dc in next ch sp* repeat 6 times, turn;
Row 14 2ch, (skip 1dc, 1ch, 1dc), 1dc in next ch sp, *1ch, 1dc in next ch sp* repeat 5 times, turn;
Row 15 2ch, (skip 1dc, 1ch, 1dc), 1dc in next ch sp, *1ch, 1dc in next ch sp* repeat 4 times, turn;
Row 16 2ch, (skip 1dc, 1ch, 1dc), 1dc in next ch sp, *1ch, 1dc in next ch sp* repeat 3 times, turn;
Row 17 2ch, (skip 1dc, 1ch, 1dc), 1dc in next ch sp, *1ch, 1dc in next ch sp* repeat 2 times, turn;
Row 18 2ch, (skip 1dc, 1ch, 1dc), 1dc in next ch sp, 1ch, 1dc in next ch sp, turn;
Row 19 1ch, 1dc in first ch sp, fasten off, weave in the loose end.
Crochet chart 8.
Pic.59
To make the tie:
1. Right hand side: Crochet chart 9a.
Attach yarn to the base ch at the top side of the scarf and make: 30ch, 1dc in 2nd ch from hook,
1htr, 2tr, 3dtr, 2tr, 2ch, ss in base of last tr. Other side of the base chain: skip 1 st, make 1tr in next
st, 3dtr, 2tr, 1htr, 1dc, 1ss in top ch, and then 1ss in each of next 8 base ch, make the last ss in top
ch of 2ch, continue with 1tr in each base chain to end, finish with 1ss in dc of Row 2, pic.60.
Crochet chart 9a.
2. Left hand side: Crochet chart 9b.
Attach the yarn to the chain space of Row 2 on the other side of the scarf and follow the same
instructions to make the tie. Join the tie to the scarf with 1ss into the 1st base ch, pic.60-62.
Crochet chart 9b.
Pic.60 Pic.61 Pic.62
