hdc2tog Half double crochet decrease (1hdc over 2sts)
 Do not join first and last stitches in round
BLO Back loops only
with slip stitch if not stated otherwise.
FLO Front loops only
 When a number is followed by st, that stitch
Pic Picture
needs to be worked over that number of
stitches.
