Materials:
Yarn: Baby Chenille Yarn XL (5 Bulky) and Mini Chenille Yarn (2 Fine)
Baby Chenille Yarn XL Colour: 11 Gray (5 skeins), 07 Pink, 26 Royal Blue, 01 Snow
White, each 1 skein.
Mini Chenille Yarn Colour: 30 Amber, 46 Olive Green, 31 Bright Yellow, each 1 skein.
Crochet Hooks: 7.0 mm(US-K), 2.5 mm(US-C)
Stuffing
Stitch marker
Sewing needle
Click here to shop Baby Chenille Yarn XL
Click here to shop Mini Chenille Yarn
directsourceyarn.com
MAIN BODY (Donut Shape)
Use gray yarn, 7.0 mm hook.
R1: CH 36, join with SL ST to form ring.
R2-R3: 36 SC, 2 rounds
R4: (3 SC, INC) x9 (45)
R5: (4 SC, INC) x9 (54)
R6: (5 SC, INC) x9 (63)
R7: (6 SC, INC) x9 (72)
R8: (7 SC, INC) x9 (81)
R9: (8 SC, INC) x9 (90)
R10: (9 SC, INC) x9 (99)
R11-R15: 99 SC, 5 rounds
R16: (9 SC, DEC) x9 (90)
R17: (8 SC, DEC) x9 (81)
R18: (7 SC, DEC) x9 (72)
R19: (6 SC, DEC) x9 (63)
R20: (5 SC, DEC) x9 (54)
R21: (4 SC, DEC) x9 (45)
R22: (3 SC, DEC) x9 (36)
R23-R24: 36 SC, 2 rounds
Stuff the body and close the opening.
MILK/FROSTING
Use blue yarn, 7.0 mm hook.
It’s worked with turning rows.
R1: CH 15, work into 2nd chain from hook: 14 SC, CH 1, turn (14)
R2: (SC, INC) x7, CH 1, turn (21)
R3: 21 SC, CH 1, turn (21)
R4: (SC, INC, SC) x7, CH 1, turn (28)
R5: 28 SC, CH 1, turn (28)
R6: (3 SC, INC) x7, CH 1, turn (35)
R7: 35 SC, CH 1, turn (35)
R8: (2 SC, INC, 2 SC) x7, CH 1, turn (42)
R9: 42 SC
Leaving a long tail for sewing.
For the two sides of the frosting (Use blue yarn, 7.0 mm hook.):
Side A: CH 4, work into 2nd chain from hook 3 SC, SK 1, repeat 5 times
