@ternura_amigurumi
Pacifier Holder
We will start by leaving a long tail, and we will make
94 ch.
In chain #34 we will make 1 sl st. In that same stitch,
we will make [1sc, leave 2 stitches free, (3dc, 1picot,
2dc), leave 2 stitches free] x10. At the end make (1sc,
1ch, 1sc).
We continue on the other side. [Leave 2 stitches
free, (3dc, 1picot, 2dc), leave 2 stitches free, 1sc] x9,
leave 2 stitches free, (3dc, 1picot, 2dc), leave 2
stitches free, finish with 1 sl st.
To finish the pacifier holder, we sew the metal
pacifier holder at the end.
Hide the threads.
