as stocking stitch, knit the right side rows and purl the in inches
wrong side rows. k knit
● To work knit one under loose strand (k1 uls), insert the k2tog knit two stitches together (decrease by 1)
right needle under the loose strand below it and then kfb knit into front and back (increase by 1)
into next stitch knit-wise from front to back, knit the stitch LH left hand
and bring the new stitch out from under the loose strand. mm millimeters
● Use mattress stitch and yarn tails for seaming unless oz ounces
otherwise instructed. p purl
● To mark stitches use lockable stitch markers, or thread a p2tog purl two stitches together (decrease by 1)
piece of waste yarn through the stitch to be marked and patt pattern
