● The banana uses short rows for shaping, and the wrap rep repeat
and turn (w&t) prevents holes forming at the point of the RH right hand
turn. Pick up the wraps and knit or purl them together sl1 slip 1 stitch purl-wise
with the wrapped stitch when you encounter them. sl3 slip 3 stitches purl-wise
sl5 slip 5 stitches purl-wise
