st st stockinette (stocking) stitch
st/s stitch/es
tog together
w&t wrap and turn: work to stitch to be wrapped, on a knit
row bring yarn to the front and slip the next stitch onto the
right hand needle, return the yarn to the back, slip the stitch
back to the left hand needle and turn; on a purl row take
yarn to the back and slip the next stitch onto the right hand
needle, return the yarn to the front, slip the stitch back to the
left hand needle and turn.
