Goldfish Toy Amigurumi Crochet Pattern
Wondertime Tots
 Another way is to place an orange pipe cleaner in each fin lengthwise before you
fold the circle and sc together. Fold the ends of the pipe cleaner first so there are no
sharp ends. Now it will bend easily and stay put. Just use caution when giving to
children.
