4. (2 sc, inc) x 6= 24 5-6. Sc in each st around
5. (3 sc, inc) x 6= 30 Change to blue yarn
6. (4 sc, inc) x 6= 36 7. (6 sc, dec) x 3= 21
7. (5 sc, inc) x 6= 42 8-10. Sc in each st around
8. (6 sc, inc) x 6= 48 11. (5 sc, dec) x 3= 18
