Rnd 7: (Sc in next 5 sts, 2 sc in next st) around. (42)
Rnd 8: Sc in next 3 sts, 2 sc in next st, (sc in next 6 sts, 2 sc in next st) 5 times, sc in next 3 sts. (48)
Rnd 9: (Sc in next 7 sts, 2 sc in next st) around. (54)
Rnd 10: Sc in next 4 sts, 2 sc in next st, (sc in next 8 sts, 2 sc in next st) 5 times, sc in next 4 sts. (60)
Rnd 11: (Sc in next 9 sts, 2 sc in next st) around. (66)
Rnd 12-16: Sc in each st around.
Rnd 17: (Sc in next 9 sts, sc next 2 sts tog) around. (60)
Rnd 18: Sc in next 4 sts, sc next 2 sts tog, (sc in next 8 sts, sc next 2 sts tog) 5 times, sc in next 4 sts. (54)
Rnd 19: (Sc in next 7 sts, sc next 2 sts tog) around. (48)
Rnd 20: Sc in next 3 sts, sc next 2 sts tog, (sc in next 6 sts, sc next 2 sts tog) 5 times, sc in next 3 sts. (42)
Rnd 21: (Sc in next 5 sts, sc next 2 sts tog) around. (36)
Rnd 22: Sc in next 2 sts, sc next 2 sts tog, (sc in next 4 sts, sc next 2 sts tog) 5 times, sc in next 2 sts. (30)
Rnd 23: (Sc in next 3 sts, sc next 2 sts tog) around, join with sl st in first st, leave long end for sewing,
fasten off. (24)
Stuff head a little bit, insert safety eyes 11 sts apart between rnds 14-15 of head then stuff head more tightly.
Body
Rnd 1: With white, ch 2, 6 sc in second chain from hook. (6) * You can do 6 sc in a magic ring.*
Rnd 2: 2 sc in each st around. (12)
Rnd 3: (2 sc in next st, sc in next st) around. (18)
Rnd 4: (Sc in next 2 sts, 2 sc in next st) around. (24)
Rnd 5: (Sc in next 3 sts, 2 sc in next st) around. (30)
Rnd 6: Sc in next 2 sts, 2 sc in next st, (sc in next 4 sts, 2 sc in next st) 5 times, sc in next 2 sts. (36)
Rnd 7: (Sc in next 5 sts, 2 sc in next st) around. (42)
Rnd 8: Sc in next 3 sts, 2 sc in next st, (sc in next 6 sts, 2 sc in next st) 5 times, sc in next 3 sts. (48)
Rnd 9-14: Sc in each st around.
Rnd 15: Sc in next 7 sts, sc next 2 sts tog, (sc in next 14 sts, sc next 2 sts tog) 2 times, sc in next 7 sts. (45)
Rnd 16: (Sc in next 13 sts, sc next 2 sts tog) around. (42)
Rnd 17: Sc in each st around. (42)
Rnd 18: Sc in next 6 sts, sc next 2 sts tog, (sc in next 12 sts, sc next 2 sts tog) 2 times, sc in next 6 sts. (39)
Rnd 19: (Sc in next 11 sts, sc next 2 sts tog) around. (36)
Rnd 20: (Sc in next 4 sts, sc next 2 sts tog) around. (30)
Rnd 21: (Sc in next 3 sts, sc next 2 sts tog) around, join with sl st in first st, leave long end for sewing,
fasten off. (24) Stuff the body and sew to head.
