Little+pumpkin+keychain;https://www.lovecrafts.com/en-gb/p/little-pumpkin-keychain-crochet-pattern-by-amigurumijoys;"ABBREVIATIONS:
mr, sc n = magic ring (UK=magic ring) –
crochet n single crochet stitches into
the adjustable loop.
st/sts = stitch/stitches
Cs = chain stitch (UK=chain)
sl st = slip stitch (UK=slip stitch)
sc = single crochet stitch (UK=double crochet)
inc = increase = 2 sc in one st
dec = decrease = two sc together
(sc 4, inc) x n = repeat the";"pattern between
parentheses n times
[n] = the number of stitches in the round
SIZE: 0.98 (2 cm) height and 1.77 inches (4,5 cm) wide
SUPPLIES:
- 1.75 mm crochet hook;
- yarn: Yarnart Jeans green color 69, orange color 70.
- Scissors, stitch marker or scrap piece of yarn;
- soft stuffing;
- yarn needle.
TIP! You can use the same pattern to make larger or smaller toys by using finer or bulkier yarn. Also
you can use a different color yarn. Pick a crochet hook at least a size smaller than suggested on yarn
label and crochet tightly enough to achieve a tight gauge that will not allow the stuffing to show
through the fabric.
*Amigurumi_Joys crochet patterns are protected by international copyright laws and are intended
for personal use only. All rights reserved. It is prohibited to distribute instructions on paper or
electronically (you may NOT sell or share the patterns, do not post them on the Internet, or translate
them into other languages). You may NOT resell my patterns, but you are welcome to sell any of the
