2
PUMPKIN Use orange color yarn
Round 1: mr, sc 6 = [6]
Round 2: inc x 6 = [12]
Round 3: (sc 1, inc) x 6 = [18]
Round 4: (sc 2, inc) x 6 = [24]
Round 5: (sc 3, inc) x 6 = [30]
Round 6-11(6 rounds): sc in each st around = [30]
Round 12: (sc 3, dec) x 6 = [24]
Round 13: (sc 2, dec) x 6 = [18] Stuff tightly.
Round 14: (sc 1, dec) x 6 = [12]
Round 15: dec 6 = [6]
Cut off the yarn leaving a long yarn tail (about 30 inches(80 cm)) for fasten off and create ribbing
for the pumpkin.
RIBBING
Create approx 7-8 sections of the ribbing for the pumpkin to give it its shape.
To do this take the long end of the tail from the bottom of the pumpkin after you fasten off and
attach to a sewing needle, pass through the centre of the magicring start and through the centre
of the pumpkin and back through the bottom centre, pull yarn to tighten.
You can watch a video totorial on how to make ribbing here
(Click on the link or scan QR code):
https://youtu.be/Wrn4xlDvKoY
STEM WITH A TENDRIL Use green color yarn
Row 1: Chain 7 , turn back with sc 6 starting from the second
chain from the hook, Chain 12, turn back with sl st 11 starting
from the second chain from the hook. Twist the tendril slightly.
Cut off the yarn leaving a long yarn tail for sewing and fasten off.
A video on how to make the stem with the tendril you can watch
here (click on the link or scan QR code):
https://youtu.be/yah32aztbWM
LEAFUse green color yarn
Cs 5(start crocheting from the 3rd chain from the hook)
Sc 2, sl st, Cs and sl st(in the same chain), continue crochet on the other side
of the beginning of the chain sc 2, Cs 2, sl st.
Cut the yarn leaving a long yarn tail for sewing and fasten off
Watch a video on how to make the leaf (click on the link or scan QR code):
https://youtu.be/EF_065XD_L4
Sew the stem with the tendril to the pumpkin.
You can watch an assembling video here
(click on the link or sсan QR code):
https://youtu.be/lSyZCgEQ-H4
