about 36 inches long for attaching to
the white/grey part.
Leave a long tail for attaching to the head.
The head fits into the black semi circle and
you whip stitch around the outer edge to
attach the two pieces.
Using the long tail of the back of the head, I used a small black button for the nose.
whip stitch the body and head together.
