Little Red Riding Hood Hair
For the doll with black hair, little red riding
hood, we are going to now stitch into those
back loops to add hair. Grab one of the back
loops as shown, yarn over, and pull through.
You’ll now have your hook attach to begin
crocheting across into each of those back
loops. Sc into 12 of the outer loops to form
the foundation row for the long hair. Ch 2.
Turn.
Now DC across for 3 rows, Chaining 2 at the
end of each row with the turn.
Finish off and weave in your ends.
