rnd 3 (3 Sc, 1 DEC) x 6 (24)
rnd 4 (1 Sc, 1 DEC, 1 Sc) x 6 (18)
rnd 5 (1 Sc, 1 DEC) x 6 (12)
rnd 6 (1 Sc, 1 DEC) x 4 (8)
rnd 7 -20 8 Sc (8) (14 rounds)
rnd 21 2 Sc, (1 Sc, 1 INC) x 3 (11)
rnd 22 11 Sc (11)
rnd 23 2 Sc, (1 Sc, 1 INC, 1 Sc) x 3 (14)
rnd 24 14 Sc (14)
rnd 25 2 Sc, (3 Sc, 1 INC) x 3 (17)
rnd 26 17 Sc (17)
rnd 27 2 Sc, (2 Sc, 1 INC, 2 Sc) x 3 (20)
rnd 28 20 Sc (20)
rnd 29 2 Sc, (5 Sc, 1 INC) x 3 (23)
rnd 30 23 Sc (23)
rnd 31 2 Sc, (3 Sc, 1 INC, 3 Sc) x 3 (26)
