Pre-felting & assembly instructions
1 Using the long tail of yarn attached to each piece securely sew both eyes & nose onto head
by oversewing round their edges making sure to catch every stitch. Position on face as seen in
photographs a, b & c on next page. Place each eye a few stitches apart and line up the bottom
straight edge of each eye along the top of muzzle. Place nose on front of muzzle lining up one of the
corners with the center ring of 8dc workied in first round of crocheting the head. Trim any long tails
left on your crocheted pieces now otherwise they will all tangle & felt together in the
washing machine.
Page 6
