Alternative colourway
If you want to make a Marlion using up bits of yarn in your stash like I did first of all (as picture below).
This is the break down of amounts of yarn needed to make the various parts.
Foot base (all 4) 48g
All pad cricles & Limbs 20g
Body 22g
Head 20g
Mane 218g for a full head of locks
Ears 4g
Nose 2g
Tail 8g
Eyes oddments of black & white
Smiley mouth oddment of dark coloured yarn
I used up some Rowanspun 4ply/fingering weight yarnfor the main body parts in red, orange, turquoise,
purple & an oddment of green for nose. The mane & tail are in Kauni EQ rainbow & the eyes in oddments of
Jaegar pure wool.
