Sweet Oddity Art 10
Flower for Long Hair Mermaid:
Make a magic ring
1. Ch 1, make 6 sc into the magic ring. Join to the first sc in the loop with a sl st.
2. Ch 2, 2 dc in the same stitch as the join. Ch 2, then sl st into same stitch. *3 dc in the next
stitch, ch 2, sl st into the same stitch*. Repeat around. F/O.
