Assembly
Hair for Mermaids:
1. Pin the hair cap onto the head. Sew the hair cap onto the head.
2. Pin the bun onto the head and sew into place.
3. Make the band for around the bun. Ch approximately 36, you may need to adjust the
amount of chains. Sl st the band together. Place around the bun and sew into place.
4. Pin the flower onto the side of the bun and sew into place.
Sweet Oddity Art 12
2nd Mermaid Hair:
1. Pin one of the strands of hair onto one side of the head. Go down a
Straight line on the back of the head. Sew the piece on the head.
2. Pin another strand of the hair onto the head right underneath the first piece. Sew it
onto the head.
3. Pin the 3rd strand onto the other side of the head in the same manner and sew it on
the head.
4. Pin the final and 4th strand onto the head underneath the 3rd piece. Sew it on and
Weave in the ends.
5. Pin the flower onto the side of the head and sew into place.
