Metroid/Komayto;https://www.lovecrafts.com/en-gb/p/metroid-komayto-amigurumi-plush-toy-crochet-pattern-by-starbeamer-patterns;"Abbreviations Used:
Ch = chain Sc = single crochet * = repeat
Dec = invisible decrease Sl St = slip stitch
Inc = increase St = stitch
Note: Do not join unless specified in the";"pattern. Also, use regular color changes for this pattern
Teeth/ Tentacle, Small (make two):
Ch 13 in white and join the row.
1-3. Sc* (13)
4. Sc in the next 7st, dec 3 times (10)
5. Sc in the next 6 st, dec 2 times (8)
6. Sc in the next 6 st, dec once (7)
Sl st once, cut the yarn tail and pull it through the final loop. Sew the stitches at the end of the teeth
together.
Teeth/Tentacle, Large (make two):
Ch 12 in white and join the row.
1-7. Sc* (12)
8. Sc in the next 6 st, dec 3 times (9)
9. Sc in the next 5 st, dec 2 times (7)
10. Sc in the next 5 st, dec once (6)
Sl st once, cut the yarn tail and pull it through the final loop. Sew the stitches at the end of the teeth
together.
