Body:
1. In green, sc 6 in a magic ring.
2. Inc* (12)
3. (Sc in the next st, inc in the next st)* (18)
4. (Sc in the next 2 st, inc in the next st)* (24)
5. (Sc in the next 3 st, inc in the next st)* (30)
6. (Sc in the next 4 st, inc in the next st)* (36)
7. (Sc in the next 5 st, inc in the next st)* (42)
8. (Sc in the next 6 st, inc in the next st)* (48)
9-19. Sc* (48)
20. (Sc in the next 6 st, dec once)* (42)
21. (Sc in the next 5 st, dec once)* (36)
22. (Sc in the next 4 st, dec once)* (30)
Change to red and stuff as the hole gets smaller.
23. (Sc in the next 3 st, dec once)* (24)
24. (Sc in the next 2 st, dec once)* (18)
25 (Sc in the next 2 st, dec once)*4 times, sc in the next 2 st (14)
Stuff.
26. (Dec once, sc in the next 2 st,)*3 times, dec once (10)
Sl st once, cut the yarn tail and pull it through the final loop. Sew the hole shut.
If you crochet really tightly, after row 27, dec 5 times to bring the number of st down to 5. If you crochet
loose and you do this, it will create a pucker.
Eyes (make three):
(Ch 2, dc 12) in a magic ring in red, join and bind off. Leave a long tail to sew the eyes to the metroid.
Sew the middle tail down to the back of the eyes, so it does not get in the way when sewing them down.
