CROCHET PATTERN CHICKEN
TOOL AND MATERIALS
◊ Crochet hook 2mm for all parts and 1mm - for the
nose
◊ Stuffing (fiberfill or polyester cluster filling)
◊ Scissors
◊ Bernat Crushed Velvet Yarn, White. Ball Size: 300
g/10. 5 oz, 288 m/315 yds, Yarn Size #5 Bulky
◊ A little bit red yarn - for comb ( Weight size 3 or 4)
◊ Aunt Lydia - for nose, size 10 crochet thread, Bed-
spread weight, 3 play
