WE MAKE lOW-SEW PATTERN
:
◊ We crochet the entire CHICKEN without sewing any parts but a beak.
◊ I utilize a contrasting yarn scrap to mark the start of each round, aiding in achieving sym-
metry for the toy.
◊ The gauge doesn`t matter.
◊ My gauge - 1 inch for 4 sc and 5 rounds.
