Body
Rnd 1: 4 SC in magic ring [4]
Rnd 2: 4 INC [8]
Rnd 3: (INC, SC) x4 [12]
Rnd 4: (2 SC, INC) x4 [16]
Rnd 5: 16 SC [16]
Rnd 6: (3 SC, INC) x4 [20]
Rnd 7: 20 SC [20]
