Ch 1. Flatten the body, SC both sides together [18]
Fasten off
Tip: Stuff the body firmly before the last 6 stitches.
Mouth
Use yellow yarn
Ch 10. Stitches are worked around both sides of the foundation chain.
Start in second chain from the hook, 8 SC, 3 SC in the last stitch,
Continue on the other side of the foundation chain, 7 SC, INC in the last stitch.
[20]
Big Eye
Use white yarn
Rnd 1: 5 SC in magic ring [5]
Rnd 2: 5 INC [10]
Small Eye
Use white yarn
Rnd 1: 8 SC in magic ring [8]
Cyclops
Use green yarn
Rnd 1: 8 SC in magic ring [8]
Change to white yarn
Rnd 2: 8 INC [16]
