If using safety eyes, insert between rounds 15
and 16, 11 stitches apart.
26) (sc x 3, dec) x 6 [24]
Stuff the head and continue stuffing until fastened
off.
27) (sc x 2, dec) x 6 [18]
28) (sc, dec) x 6 [12]
29) dec x 6 [6]
Fasten off and weave tail through final round, pull
to close.
Arms (PURPLE, make 2):
1) 6 sc in MR [6]
2) inc x 6 [12]
