3) (sc, inc) x 6 [18]
4) sc x 18 [18]
5) in BLO: sc x 18 [18]
6) (sc x 7, dec) x 2 [16]
Change to BEIGE.
7) (sc x 6, dec) x 2 [14]
8) sc x 14 [14]
Change to APRICOT.
9-18) sc x 14 [14]
Fasten off, stuff rounds 1-8 and sc across top.
Leave a tail for sewing.
Legs (PURPLE, make 2):
1) 8 sc in MR [8]
2) inc x 8 [16]
3) (sc, inc) x 8 [24]
4-5) sc x 24 [24]
