7) (sc x 5, dec) x 3 [18]
Change to BEIGE.
8-9) sc x 18 [18]
Change to APRICOT.
10-18) sc x 18 [18]
Fasten off, stuff and sc across the top to
close. Leave a tail for sewing.
Body (APRICOT):
1) 6 sc in MR [6]
2) inc x 6 [12]
3) (sc, inc) x 6 [18]
4) (sc x 2, inc) x 6 [24]
5) (sc x 3, inc) x 6 [30]
