(I used less than a 125m/50g ball of each ch = chain
color when making this project) sc = single crochet
Stuffing inc/2 sc inc = increase (2 sc per stitch)
Crochet hook 3 sc inc = 3 sc per stitch
Tapestry needle dec = decrease (sc across two stitches)
sl st = slip stitch
f/o = fasten off
Notes
If crocheted with sport yarns and 2.2 mm hook, No Face amigurumi should measure about 9 cm
tall. The similar yarn you can use is Schachenmayr Catania (100% cotton; 50 g (1.8 oz); 125 m
(137yds)).
You can use any yarn and hook combination you want. Its size may vary according to the
materials you used.
