the sole permission of Travelling Ava & Co.
To assemble Notamouse
Pictures are provided as a guide to help you position the ears, arms and legs.
Fold ears so they are flat, stitch the seam together and stitch to the body, use the
photos as a guide for positioning the ears to the body.
Cut 3 strands for the tail, approximately 25 cm, Thread through a stitch at the base
of the body and plait the strands securing with a knot at the end.
