Using yellow yarn. ch 7, starting in the 3rd chain from the hook.
row 1 1 hdc, 1 dc, 1 hdc, (5)
2 slst
Cut the yarn and fasten off, leaving a long tail for sewing.
ASSEMBLY
Place the beak on the front of the body on rounds 9 through 11 and sew in
place using the long yarn tail. Place the wings on either side of the body
between rounds 11 and 12 and sew in place using the long yarn tails. Sew the
feather to the top of the head.
Sew the eyes on either side of the face above the beak using black embroidery
thread. Leave about six stiches in between. Add cheek highlights below the eyes
using pink yarn.
