Assembly
- Sew the beak to the body on the other side of the tail, more or less between R11-R16.
- Sew the wings to the side of the body more or less on R15/R16.
- Slip the long tail of the leaf into the middle of the leaf, then sew it to the top of the head
more or less on R4.
- Hide any yarn tails.
- Glue the eyes on top of the beak approx. 6-7st apart.
