Cut black felt into 2 circle with approx diameter of 0.5cm
Glue the black felt to the middle of the circle felt
Assembly
- Sew the beak to the body on the other side of the tail, more or less between R9-R12.
- Sew the wings to the side of the body more or less on R12/R13.
- Sew the towel to the top of the head.
- Hide any yarn tails.
- Glue the eyes on top of the beak approx. 6-7st apart.
