Rnd 11: 8 SC, (2 SC, INC) x2, INC, 6 SC, (2 SC, INC) x3, 6 SC [42]
Rnd 12: 9 SC, (3 SC, INC) x3, INC, 3 SC, (3 SC, INC) x3, 6 SC [48]
Rnd 13-15: 48 SC [48], 3 rounds
Rnd 16: 9 SC, DEC, 8 SC, DEC, 6 SC, DEC, 8 SC, DEC, 9 SC [44]
Rnd 17: 9 SC, (6 SC, DEC) x3, DEC, 9 SC [40]
