Rnd 3: 12 SC [12]
Rnd 4: (2 SC, DEC) x3 [9]
Fasten off the first leg.
Change to Rose Pink yarn. Connect the two legs with Ch 3
We are going to crochet the body.
Rnd 5 Rose Pink: 24 SC [24] Tip: 9 SC in the first leg, 3 SC in one side of the
chain, 9 SC in the second leg, 3 SC in other side of the chain, total 24 stitches.
Rnd 6 Rose Pink: 4 SC, INC, (5 SC, INC) x 2, 7 SC [27]
Rnd 7 Rose Pink: 5 SC, INC, 6 SC, INC, 5 SC, INC, 8 SC [30]
Rnd 8 Black: (6 SC, INC) x3, 9 SC [33]
Rnd 9-10: Rose Pink: 33 SC [33], 2 rounds
Rnd 11: Black: 33 SC [33]
Rnd 12: Rose Pink: (9 SC, DEC) x3 [30]
Rnd 13: Rose Pink: 30 SC [30]
Rnd 14: Black: (8 SC, DEC) x3 [27]
Rnd 15: Rose Pink: 27 SC [27]
Rnd 16: Rose Pink: (7 SC, DEC) x3 [24]
Stuff the body firmly.
Fasten off.
Nose
Use rose pink yarn.
Rnd 1: 6 SC in magic ring [6]
Change to soft Pink yarn
Rnd 2: 6 INC [12]
Rnd 3: BLO 12 SC [12]
Stuff the nose firmly.
Cut the yarn, leaving a long tail for sewing.
Arm (make 2)
Use soft pink yarn.
Rnd 1: 6 SC in magic ring [6]
Rnd 2: (2 SC, INC) x 2 [8]
Rnd 3-4: 8 SC [8], 2 rounds
Don’t stuff the arms.
Cut the yarn, leaving a long tail for sewing.
Ear (make 2)
Use rose pink yarn.
Rnd 1: 4 SC in magic ring [4]
Rnd 2: (SC, INC) x 2 [6]
Rnd 3: (SC, INC, SC) x 2 [8]
Rnd 4: (SC, INC) x4 [12]
Rnd 5: (SC, INC) x6 [18]
Rnd 6-7: 18 SC [18], 2 rounds
Rnd 8: (2SC, DEC, 2SC) x 3 [15]
Rnd 9: 15 SC [15]
Rnd 10: (3 SC, DEC) x 3 [12]
Rnd 11: (SC, DEC) x 4 [8]
Don’t stuff the ears.
Cut the yarn, leaving a long tail for sewing.
Assembly
Sew the nose to the head between rounds 12-15.
Sew the ears to the head between rounds 3-6.
Sew the head to the body.
Sew the arms to the body.
