Assembly
Head and Body:
1. Take a very long strand of pink yarn, thread your needle with it. Insert the needle into
the magic ring and bring the needle to a stitch on top of the nose between rounds 2
and 3. Bring the needle back down to the magic ring to start embroidering the nose.
Pull the yarn to tighten it up and repeat about 12 more times. Weave in the yarn tails.
2. Pin the head to the body for extra support.
3. Sew the head to the body, you may need to add more stuffing as you sew.
Arms:
1. Pin the arms approximately between rounds 36 and 37, on the side of the body.
2. Sew the arms onto the body.
Sweet Oddity Art 12
Sleeves:
1. Pin the sleeves onto the body. Wrap the sleeve around the top over the arms. Pin in
the back and the front.
2. Sew the sleeves onto the body on the front, back and sides. Weave in the tails.
