rounds 12 and 13 underneath the skirt. I did not want a tail on my girl mouse so I have
no pictures for that.
2. Sew the tail onto the body.
Embellishments:
1. Pin the purple waistband around the body. Sew the band onto the body.
2. If you want the rhinestones, place one on the front of the sleeves with glue or get
self adhesive rhinestones. I chose to place one on since this was for my daughter that is
7 years old. I would not recommend for children under 3 years of age.
3. Cut a long strand of black embroidery thread. Thread your needle and embroider 3
lines next to each eye for eyelashes.
4. Add some blush to the cheeks with actual blush if you want.
