Rainbow Bear;https://www.lovecrafts.com/en-gb/p/rainbow-bear-crochet-pattern-by-torya-winters-designs;"Abbreviations
Ch chain
Dc double crochet
Dc2tog double crochet two sts together
Dc4tog double crochet four sts together
Rem remaining
Rep repeat
Rnd round
Gauge
Not important – teddy bear will be different sizes depending on what yarn and
hook you use.
Size
My bear was 8cm tall using the recommended yarn.
Instructions
Head
Make a magic ring.
Rnd 1 - 8dc into ring
Rnd 2 - 2dc in each dc - 16dc
Rnd 3 - *2dc in first dc, 1dc in next dc, rep from * to end - 24dc
Rnds 4-8 - dc in every dc all round
Rnd 9 - *dc2tog in first dc, 1dc in next dc, rep from * to end - 16dc
Start to stuff head.
Rnd 10 - dc2tog in each dc - 8dc
Rnd 11 - dc2tog in each dc - 4dc
Fasten off and leave end for sewing up.
© Torya Winters Designs, 2020. www.toryawintersdesigns.com
Body
Make a magic ring.
Rnd 1 - 8dc into ring
Rnd 2 - 2dc in each dc - 16dc
Rnd 3 - *2dc in first dc, 1dc in next dc, rep from * to end - 24dc
Rnd 4 - *2dc in first dc, 1dc in next 2dc, rep from * to end - 32dc
Rnds 5-14 - dc in every dc all round
Rnd 15 - *dc2tog in first dc, 1dc in next 2dc, rep from * to end - 24dc
Rnd 16 - *dc2tog in first dc, 1dc in next dc, rep from * to end - 16dc
Start to stuff body.
Rnd 17 - dc2tog in each dc - 8dc
Rnd 18 - dc2tog in each dc - 4dc
Fasten off and leave end for sewing up. Attach head to body.
Ears (make 2 the same)
Make a magic ring.
Rnd 1 - 8dc into ring
Rnd 2 - 2dc in each dc - 16dc
Fasten off, fold in half and sew the curved edges together. Sew ears to head.
Arms (make 2 the same)
Make a magic ring.
Rnd 1 - 8dc into ring
Rnd 2-10 - dc in each dc all round
Fasten off, stuff and sew to sides of body.
Legs (make 2 the same)
Ch 4
Dc into second chain from hook, dc in next ch, dc3 in next ch, turn and work
into other side of foundation ch, dc in next 2 ch, dc3 in last ch - 10 dc
Rnds 1-3 - dc in each dc all round
Rnd 4 - dc in first 3dc, dc4tog, dc in rem 3dc - 7dc
Stuff foot.
Rnds 5-10 - dc in each dc all round
Fasten off, stuff and sew to body.
