Recycle cheerful Amigurumi ideas;https://www.lovecrafts.com/en-gb/p/recycle-cheerful-amigurumi-ideas-crochet-pattern-by-reham-youssef;;"Recycle cheerful Amigurumi ideas
Designer: Reham Youssef
Written by R.Y amigurumi design team 1
Recycle cheerful Amigurumi ideas
Designer: Reham Youssef
Introduction:
Hello our friends and amigurumi lovers around the world, we are happy to share with you our
amigurumi recycle ideas pattern, don’t throw anything away because we will recycle it into this
beautiful items. In this pattern we need only (plastic mineral water bottles top, leftover threads
yarn, crochet hook and glue gun). Crochet and amigurumi beginners will have a good chance to
produce items with zero sewing. Such a beautiful ideas are multi use as a keychain, educational,
and also it is wonderful to use them as toys for children, safe and easy to clean and wash. This
pattern is written and designed by Reham Youssef the owner of R.Y amigurumi and please note
that it is for your personal used only and it is not allowed to sharing and reselling in Internet, we
are the owner of this pattern and for any issue related to that please contact with us by using our
email: reham.youssef821974@gmail.com
