 If you have any question about the pattern, please send an email to:
reham.youssef821974@gmail.com
 You can able to buy the used yarns from www.ravelry.com
 This pattern is worked in continuous rounds and gauge is not important in this pattern
 In this pattern we will create a main item from the plastic mineral water bottles top
and then use it in different ways to create a lot of ideas
