6
Then bring the needle back to the front in the middle of the ring again and stitch
back into the ring, making a loop to go around the nose.
Hold the loop around the nose and bring the needle to the top of the nose right
under the loop.
Then stitch back into the top over the loop to keep the loop in place.
Start at the bottom of the nose and stitch on the mouth.
