Round 11 1sc in each st [10sts]
Round 12 (1sc, 2sc in next st) rep to end [15sts]
Round 13-14 1sc in each st [15sts]
Round 15 (2sc, 2sc in next st) rep to end [20sts]
Round 16-19 1sc in each st [20sts]
Round 20 2sctog in next 10sts, 1sc in next 10 sts [15sts]
Round 21 1sc in each st [15sts]
Round 22 2sc in next 5sts, 1sc in next 10sts [20sts]
Fill with stuffing and cut the thread.
Arms (make 2)
Round 1 with Pink yarn 6sc in magic ring.
Round 2-6 1sc in each st [6sts]
Round 7 1sc, 2sc in next st, 1sc, 1sc, 2sc in next st, 1sc [8sts]
Round 8 1sc in each st [8sts]
Fill with stuffing and cut the thread.
2
Horse body
Round 1 with Brown yarn 6sc in magic ring.
Round 2 2sc in each st [12sts]
Round 3 (1sc, 2sc in next st) rep to end [18sts]
Round 4 (2sc, 2sc in next st) rep to end [24sts]
Round 5-7 1sc in each st [24sts]
Round 8 (1sc in next 2sts, 2sctog) rep to end [18sts]
Round 9-13 1sc in each [18sts]
Round 14 (1sc, 2sc in next st) rep to end [24sts]
Round 15-16 1sc in each st [24sts]
Round 17 (1sc in next 2sts, 2sctog) rep to end [18sts]
Round 18 (1sc in next st, 2sctog) rep to end [12sts]
Round 19 2sctog rep to end [6sts]
Fill with stuffing and cut the thread.
Legs
(make 4)
Round1 with Black yarn 8sc in magic ring.
Round 2-3 1sc in each st [8sts]
join with Brown yarn
Round 4 2sctog, 1sc, 1sc, 2sctog, 1sc, 1sc [6sts]
Round 5-7 1sc in each st [6sts]
Round 8 2sc in next st, 1sc, 1sc, 2sc in next st, 1sc, 1sc [8sts]
Round 9 1sc in each st [9sts]
Round 10 (2sc in next st, 1sc) rep to end [ 12sts]
Round 11 2sc in the first st, then 1sc in each st [13sts]
Round 12 1sc in the first 11 sts then turn [11sts]
Round 13 from second st 1sc in next 6sts [6sts]Round 14 from second st 1sc in next 4sts [4sts]
Round 15 from second st 1sc in next 2sts [2sts]
Fill with stuffing and cut the thread.
Hair
Round 1 with Black yarn 10sc in magic ring.
Round 2 2sc in each st [20sts]
Round 3-6 1sc in each st, turn [20sts]
3
Round 7 from second st 8sc, turn [8sts]
Round 8 from second st 6sc, turn [6sts]
Round 9 from second st 4sc, turn [4sts]
Cut the thread.
To make hair come in and out with the needle and black thread in the base just made, leaving a bit of thread each
time you pull the needle. Once the hair has been made, cut them all the same and tie them together as in the
picture.
Sew your arms to the human body, this to the horse's body, then sew the four paws to the horse's body.
Sew hair with the base on head.
Apply your eyes, preferably plastic.
Bow and Arrow
Round 1 With Light Brown, ch 16, skip the ch closest to the hook, hdc in the next ch, sl st in the next 2 chs, sc in the
next 2 chs, 2 sc in the next ch, sc in the next 3 chs, 2 sc in the next ch, sc in the next 2 chs, sl st in the next 2 chs, hdc
in the last ch; turn. [17 sts]
Round 2 Ch 1, hdc in the 1st st, sl st in the next 15 sts, hdc in the last st; break yarn. [17sts]
Cut the thread.
For the arrow I used a toothpick that I wrapped in gray wire, at one end I glued three chains making a small triangle.
Sew the bow on your arms and stick the arrow.
