Body
(Using Snow)
Rnd 1: 6 Sc in magic ring. [6]
Rnd 2: 6 Sc. [6]
Change color to red
Rnd 3: (Inc) x 6. [12]
Rnd 4: (3 Sc, Inc) x 3. [15]
Rnd 5: (4 Sc, Inc) x 3. [18]
Rnd 6: (2 Sc, Inc) x 6. [24]
Rnd 7: 24 Sc. [24]
Rnd 8: (3 Sc, Inc) x 6. [30]
Change color to beige
Rnd 9: BLO(4 Sc, Inc) x 6. [36]
Rnd 10-13: 36 Sc (4 rounds). [36]
Change color to red
Rnd 14-15: 36 Sc (2 rounds). [36]
Rnd 16: 14 Sc, change color to beige Puff, change color
to red 6 Sc, change color to beige Puff, change color to
red 14 Sc. [36]
Puff stitch
(Insert the hook in stitch,
yarn over, pull up the loop
through st) repeat this 4
times more in the same st.
Change color to red. Yarn
over and pull though all
loops on hook.
