Smurf amigurumi free pattern;https://www.lovecrafts.com/en-gb/p/smurf-puffo-crochet-pattern-by-valery-lab;;"Smurf amigurumi free pattern
English version (Sorry for my English!)
Wool acrylic 100% Light Blue and White
2mm hook
Tapestry needle
Stuffing
Plastic eyes
The smurf is about 10cm high.
Stitches used:
 magic ring
 chain (ch)
 single crochet (sc)
 half double crochet (hdc)
 double crochet (dc)
 treble crochet (tr)
 slip stitch (sl st)
 2dctog = work 2 dc together
 back loop = insert hook under back loop only
Head and body:
Work in circular rows.
Round 1 with Light Blue yarn 10sc in magic ring.
Round 2 2sc in each st [20sts]
Round 3-9 1sc in each st [20sts]
Round 10 (2sctog) rep to end [10sts]
Round 11 1sc in each st [10sts]
Round 12 (1sc, 2sc in next st) rep to end [15sts]
Round 13-14 1sc in each st [15sts]
Round 15 (2sc, 2sc in next st) rep to end [20sts]
Round 16 1sc in each st [20sts]
join White yarn
Round 17-19 1sc in each st [20sts]
stuff
Now we work a leg, continues with the white yarn.
Counts 10 stitches and join with a chain the last point made with 10° stitch.
Round 20 3sc, 2sctog, 3sc, 2sctog + chain initially made [9sts]
Round 21 2sctog working in the chain and in the first sc [8sts]
Round 22 1sc in each st [8sts]
Now we will work a foot, continues with the white yarn
Round 23 2hdc in next st, 1dc and 1tr in next st, 2tr in next st, 1tr and 1dc in next st, 2hdc in next
st, 1sc in next 3st [13st]
Round 24 1sc in each st [13sts]
Round 25 work sl st for all the way around in back loop [13sts]
Fill with stuffing, sew the two ends and cut the thread.
Work the other leg and foot in the same way.
Arms:
Round 1 with Light Blue yarn 6sc in magic ring.
Round 2 1sc in each st [6sts]
Round 3 (1sc, 2sctog) rep to end [4sts]
Round 4-6 1sc in each st [4sts]
Fill with stuffing, cut the thread, sew them to the body.
Ears:
Round 1 with Light Blue yarn 5sc in magic ring.
Round 2 2sc in each st [10sts]
Cut the thread, sew them to the body.
Nose:
Round 1 with Light Blue yarn 6sc in magic ring.
Round 2 (1sc, 2sctog) rep to end [4sts]
Round 3 1sc in each st [4sts]
Fill with stuffing, cut the thread, sew it to the center of the head.
Hat:
Round 1 with White yarn 10sc in magic ring.
Round 2-9 1sc in each st [10sts]
Round 10 2sc in each st [20sts]
Round 11 (1sc in next 3st, 2sc in next st) rep to end [25sts]
Round 12-14 1sc in each st [25sts]
Fill the top with a bit of stuffing and sew it on the head, glue the eyes and here it is your Smurf :)
