For the eyes:
1. Take the eyes and paint them with white acrylic paint. You can sand them before you
paint the eyes to make the paint adhere better. You will need to do a couple to four layers of
white paint.
Do this for both sparky and persephone’s eyes.
2. After the white is completely dry, paint a small black dot in the center of the eyes.
Make sure the black dot is even on both eyes.
3. Seal the eyes with nail polish sealer.
