Spring Bunny Amigurumi Crochet Pattern
Wondertime Tots
To make a sloppy slip knot: wrap the yarn around the hook two or three times, holding the bottom of the yarn at the hook and
then crochet as directed. Once the first round is completed, pull the tail tight as you hold the loop you just finished. Your loop
will be tighter and there won’t be any hole in the center.
Materials Needed
 1 Skein Red Heart yarn, white and blue (or your choice of colors)
 (2) 12mm black safety eyes OR make yarn eyes for children under 3 (no choking hazard)
 Crochet hook H / 5.00 mm
 Crochet hook G / 4.25 mm
 Polyester fiberfill stuffing
 Yarn needle for attaching ears
NOTES: The bunny is made with the legs first then with the legs connected by single crochet. Then
the body of the bunny is worked up with the arms being attached by single crochet within the
round. You can make the arms first or as you go along. The rest of the bunny is finished as one
piece. The ears are made separately then attached to the head by whip stitching them on with a
yarn needle.
Legs- Make 2, fasten off the first leg but continue single crocheting with the second leg as directed
Start with a sloppy slip knot and chain 2
R1- Working in the back loops only (you can go through both loops if you like that better) until
pattern says otherwise: Sc 8 times in the 2nd chain from the hook (8 sc)
R2- Sc 2 times in each stitch around, increasing to 16 sc
R3- (Sc 2 times in the first st, sc once in the next sc) repeat around to the end of the round (24 sc)
Rounds 4 and 5: Sc once in each stitch around (24 sc)
R6- (Sc2tog, then sc once in the next st) repeat around, decreasing to 16 sc
R7- Sc once in each st (16 sc) STOP TO STUFF FOOT
R8- Sc2tog 6 times, decreasing your stitches to 10 sc – move stitch marker
Rounds 9 to 18: Sc once in each stitch around (10 sc) STOP TO STUFF LEG TO THE TOP
Slip stitch to the next st and fasten off first foot. Repeat Rounds 1- 18 for the 2nd leg then continue
With Leg 2: Place legs side by side so the feet are facing frontward and slip stitch together 2 times
in the middle where the legs meet so there is no hole between the legs. You can also stitch the hole
later.
