Spring Bunny Amigurumi Crochet Pattern
Wondertime Tots
Stuff leg 2 to the top and continue with the next round which now includes the
count for both legs as a single round.
R19- Sc once in each stitch around (20 sc) (count only the outside stitches)
R20- Sc once in each stitch around (20 sc)
R21- Sc 2 times in the first st, sc once in the next 9 st, sc 2 in the next st, sc once in the remaining
stitches (22 sc)
R22- Sc once in each stitch (22 sc)
R23-change yarn to blue, work in the front loop only: sc once around (22 sc)
Rounds 24-29 in both loops: Sc once in each stitch around (22 sc)
R30- (Sc2tog, sc once in the next 3 sc) repeat around, decreasing to 17 sc
R31- Sc once in each st around (17 sc), sc next 5 st and move marker – STUFF FIRMLY
R32 –Add arms to this row on the side, sc through both sides of the arm and the body together:
Sc the first 5 stitches then connect the arm to the body over the next 4 stitches, continue to sc until
you reach the same spot on the opposite side and sc the 2nd arm to the body, sc to the end in any
remaining stitches in the round
Rounds 33 and 34: Sc once in each stitch around (17sc)
R35- Change to whit yarn: in back loop only, (sc2tog, sc once in the next 2 stitches) repeat around
until you have decreased to 13 sc
Rounds 36 and 37: Sconce in each st around (13 sc)
R38- Sc once in the next 4, sc 2 in the next 2, sc once in the next 7 (15 sc)
R39- Sc 2 in the first, sc once in the next 9, sc 2 in the next, sc once in next 5 (17 sc) move marker
R40- Sc once in the next 2, sc 2 in the next two st, sc once the next 2, sc 2 in the next 2, sc once the
next 3, sc 2 in the next 2 (23 sc)
Rounds 41 and 42: Sc once around in each st (23 sc)
R43- Sc next 10, sc 2 in the next st, sc once in the next, sc 2 in the next, sc once in the last 8 sc (25 sc)
R44- Sc next 10. Sc 2 in the next st, sc once in the next, sc 2 in the next (mark here for nose), sc once
in the next, sc 2 in the next, sc once in the last 10 st (27 sc)
