Rounds 9 to 17: sc once around (8 sc)
EARS- with G hook and white yarn,
Chain 15, turn, sc 2 in the 2nd chain from the hook, sc once in the remaining stitches with 2 sc in the
last st
Slip st to the next st, without turning, sc next 14, turn, chain 1, sc next 14, slip stitch next st, sc 2 in
the next 3 st, sc once in the remaining stitches, sc next 5 and fasten off with a tail for attaching
