Spring Bunny Amigurumi Crochet Pattern
Wondertime Tots
To make the nose, thread a pink piece of yarn and loop it 3 to 4 times around a stitch then bring it
over the top and through the bottom of the nose. Keep stitching two or three stitches down looping
around each stitch to secure it.
Finish by bringing up the needle through to the side of the nose and cut the excess off.
If you have any questions, feel free to email me at crochetasaurus@netzero.net. I would love
to see your finished toy. Post your project! If you have a moment, please let me know how
you liked the pattern. Stay tuned, there are more fun patterns to come. 
OTHER NOTES AND TIPS
If you can’t find safety eyes in your craft store, try the Etsy shop 6060eyes or another one; the
service is excellent.
SPECIAL NOTE: Because your finished amigurumi creations will have small parts, please be
extremely cautious if you decide to give them to a child under 3. The safety eyes and other small
pieces, if somehow detached during play time, could be a serious choking hazard. Also, if you
decide to sell your finished purse, remember to include a warning for people purchasing your
products.
