• This bag is crocheted using two strands of worsted weight yarn
but you can just use bulky yarn instead or if you want a smaller
bag, you can use one strand of worsted weight yarn.
• The opening is about 4.75”-5”(12-12.7cm) wide, just about big
enough for your had to get in. To change the size, adjust the
amount of stitches that are skipped and chained (14) in the
