ch = chain
st = stitch
sl st = slip stitch
sc = single crochet
hdc= half double crochet
dec = single crochet over two stitches
rep = repeat
Rnd = work in the round
Row = work in rows
 In [] = the stitches to repeat for the reported numbers, e.g. “[2sc in next st, sc 2] three times”
means repeat “2sc in next st, sc 2” three times in a row;
 Between *…* = stitches to repeat around the round;
 In () = stitch count at the end of the round/row.
