This pattern uses UK terms.
• 2DC — DC twice in the same stitch (also called
• MR — magic ring
an ‘increase’).
• Ch — chain
• BLO / FLO — back loop only / front loop only
• DC — double crochet stich [US single crochet]
• DC2Tog — DC across two stitches (also called a
‘decrease’). To make this less visible, work into
the front loop only of the first stitch.
