CH = chain MC = magic ring/magic circle
SC = single crochet INC = single crochet increase (unless specified otherwise)
BLO = Back Loop Only FLO = Front Loop Only
DC = double crochet DC-INC = double crochet increase
HDC = half double crochet HDC-INC = half double crochet increase
SS = slip stitch RD = round
DEC = single crochet decrease (recommend using the invisible decrease method)
- feel free to amend as you like
3.5mm, 3mm, 2.5mm Crochet Hooks
Stuffing
Stitch Markers
Yarn Needle
Scissors
Black Safety Eyes (optional to use these or to crochet your own eyes)
Yarn as follows (all only require 1 or less skein, I use DK yarn here):
o Peach Colored Yarn (for skin)
o Navy Blue Colored Yarn (for trousers)
o Maroon Colored Yarn (for torso/arms)
o Black Colored Yarn (for hair & shoes)
o Grey Colored Yarn (for optional knife)
