Assembling
With pins, position the leaf in the top of the eggplant as if it were
a hair. Put the yarn, which is left of the leaf in the needle. Pass the
needle through one of the eggplant stitches and through one of
the stitches of the leaf, repeat the process until everything is
completely safe [Image6].Fasten off and hide the yarn.
