Assembling
With pins, position the leaves in the top of the peach as if it were
a hair. Put the yarn, which is left of the leaf in the needle. Pass the
needle through one of the peach stitches and through one of
the stitches of the edge of the leaf, repeat the process until
everything is completely safe [Image 10]. Fasten off and hide the
yarn.
