– Free Crochet Pattern
This free crochet pattern features an adorable Pooh made with Chenille
Yarn Shine in Lemon Zest and Scarlet. Using a 4.0 mm hook and simple
stitches like single crochet, this pattern is beginner-friendly and perfect
for anyone who loves amigurumi. The result is a super-soft, virant plushie
ready to hug!
Tag me @directsourceyarn
Materials Needed
• Chenille Yarn Shine:
Lemon Zest (2 skeins for body & head), Scarlet (1 skein for shirt)
• Hook: 4mm crochet hook (US G-6)
• Stuffing: Polyester fiberfill
• Embroidery needle: For details and assembly
• Safe eyes
Click here to buy yarn
Head
Use Lemon Zest yarn.
Rnd 1: 8 SC in magic ring [8]
Rnd 2: 8 INC [16]
Rnd 3: (INC, SC) x8 [24]
Rnd 4: (SC, INC, SC) x8 [32]
Rnd 5: (3 SC, INC) x8 [40]
Rnd 6-10: 40 SC [40], 5 rounds
Rnd 11: 12 SC, 4 INC, 8 SC, 4 INC, 12 SC [48]
Rnd 12-16: 48 SC [48], 5 rounds
Rnd 17: 12 SC, 4 DEC, 8 SC, 4 DEC, 12 SC [40]
Rnd 18: (SC, DEC, SC) x10 [30]
Rnd 19: (SC, DEC) x10 [20]
Rnd 20: (8 SC, DEC) x2 [18]
Stuff the head firmly.
Cut the yarn, leaving a long tail for sewing.
Leg (make 2)
Use Lemon Zest yarn
Rnd 1: 6 SC in magic ring [6]
Rnd 2: 6 INC [12]
Rnd 3: 12 SC [12]
Rnd 4: (2 SC, DEC) x3 [9]
Fasten off the first leg. Connect the two legs with Ch 3
We are going to crochet the body.
Rnd 5: 24 SC [24] Tip: 9 SC in the first leg, 3 SC in one side of the chain, 9 SC
in the second leg, 3 SC in other side of the chain, total 24 stitches.
Rnd 6: 4 SC, INC, (5 SC, INC) x 2, 7 SC [27]
Rnd 7: 5 SC, INC, 6 SC, INC, 5 SC, INC, 8 SC [30]
Rnd 8 (6 SC, INC) x3, 9 SC [33]
Rnd 9-10: 33 SC [33], 2 rounds
Change to Scarlet yarn.
Rnd 11: (9 SC, DEC) x3 [30]
Rnd 12: 30 SC [30]
Rnd 13: (3 SC, DEC) x6 [24]
Rnd 14-15: 24 SC [24], 2 rounds
Rnd 16: (SC, DEC, SC) x6 [18]
Rnd 17: 18 SC [18]
Stuff the body firmly.
Fasten off.
Nose
Use Lemon Zest yarn.
Rnd 1: 5 SC in magic ring [5]
Rnd 2: 5 INC [10]
Rnd 3: (INC, SC) x5 [15]
Rnd 4: 15 SC [15]
Stuff the nose firmly.
Cut the yarn, leaving a long tail for sewing.
Arm (make 2)
Use Lemon Zest yarn.
Rnd 1: 6 SC in magic ring [6]
Rnd 2-5: 6 SC [6], 4 rounds
Change to Scarlet yarn.
Rnd 6-8: 6 SC [6], 3 rounds
Stuff the arms.
Cut the yarn, leaving a long tail for sewing.
Ear (make 2)
Use Lemon Zest yarn.
Rnd 1: 6 SC in magic ring [6]
Rnd 2: (SC, INC) x 3 [9]
Rnd 3-4: 9 SC [9], 2 rounds
Don’t stuff the ears.
Cut the yarn, leaving a long tail for sewing.
Assembly
Sew the ears to the head between rounds 3-6.
Embroider the eyebrows with black yarn on round 7, 5 sts apart.
Glue the eyes on round 11, 5 sts apart.
Sew the nose to the head between rounds 12-16.
Embroider the mouth with black yarn between rounds 15-16,.
Sew the head to the body.
Sew the arms to the body.
