Yoga Bunny
What you need to get started ...
Yoga bunny loves to stretch and relax! The perfect
companion for mindful days.
Made using double crochet stitches, worked in the round
in the amigurumi method (in continuous spirals without
joining the end of each round with a ss) with simple
colour changes and easy accessories. Customise yours to
make your own friend!
